        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/McGill%2C_Nevada"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1908 the Steptoe Valley Smelting and Mining Company completed a smelter, shipping its first copper on Aug. 7 that year.",
